Domain Entity StudentPath
    documentation "The entity representing the association or assignment of the student to the path of study being pursued."
    domain entity Student
        documentation "A reference to the student associated with the path of study."
        is part of identity
    domain entity Path
        documentation "A reference to the path of study associated with or assigned to the student."
        is part of identity
    common Period
        documentation "The time periods for which the student was assigned and pursuing the path of study."
        is optional collection
